<title>UK: GOLF-PAST BRITISH OPEN WINNERS AT TROON.</title>
<headline>GOLF-PAST BRITISH OPEN WINNERS AT TROON.</headline>
<dateline>TROON, Scotland 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of past winners of the British Open at Royal Troon with the year, name, scores and prize money:</p>
<p>1923 Arthur Havers (Britain) 73 73 73 76 295, 75 pounds</p>
<p>1950 Bobby Locky (South Africa) 69 72 70 68 279, 300 pounds</p>
<p>1962 Arnold Palmer (U.S.) 71 69 67 69 276, 1,400 pounds</p>
<p>1973 Tom Weiskopf (U.S.) 68 67 71 70 276, 5,500 pounds</p>
<p>1982 Tom Watson (U.S.) 69 71 74 70 284, 32,000 pounds</p>
<p>1989 Mark Calcavecchia (U.S.) 71 68 68 68 275, 80,000 pounds</p>
<p>(won in four-hole play-off against Australians Greg Norman and Wayne Grady).</p>
</text>
